Appendix A-Project Charter
Project Title
Affordable Generative AI Chatbot for Small and Medium-Sized Restaurants in Australia
Problem Statement
Because of limited staff and growing workload, SME restaurants are facing difficulties in ensuring that their customers' enquiries for reservations, menu questions, and order updates are handled. During peak times, a delayed response may lower customer satisfaction and cause inefficiencies in your operation. There is a need for more affordable AI solutions to ensure timely and uniform customer service.
Value Proposition
This project is a prototype of a low-cost Generative AI chatbot for enhancing the efficiency of restaurant customer service. The goal of the chatbot is to streamline typical inquiries, alleviate the load on employees, deliver quicker responses, and facilitate ethical and responsible use of AI while ensuring privacy.

Scope
In Scope	Out of Scope
GenAI chatbot prototype	Full production deployment
FAQs, menu queries, reservations, order updates	Payment/POS integration
Accuracy, usability, and performance testing	Mobile app development
Responsible AI and privacy evaluation	Enterprise restaurant solutions

Stakeholders
Stakeholder	Role
Academic Supervisor	Sponsor and reviewer
